### =====================================
### AUTH APIs
### =====================================

### REGISTER CUSTOMER
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sruthi",
  "email": "sruthi@gmail.com",
  "password": "123456",
  "role": "customer",
  "address": "Hyderabad",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}



### REGISTER PROVIDER
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

