### MEAL APIs
### =====================================

### GET ALL MEALS
GET http://localhost:5000/api/meals



### ADD MEAL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/meals
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6IjZhMDJmOTM1ZWE4NGMwZjgzN2E2NGU3YiIsInJvbGUiOiJwcm92aWRlciIsImlhdCI6MTc3ODU3OTc3MiwiZXhwIjoxNzc5MTg0NTcyfQ.aBFY5q_QE0q8K66t-kVAE-J7TpVvFsVsm3CC7xXR0h4

{
  "title": "Veg Lunch Box",
  "description": "Rice, Curry, Dal, Roti",
  "price": 120,
  "category": "Lunch",
  "provider": "Provider One",
  "image": "https://example.com/image.jpg"
}



### ADD BREAKFAST MEAL
POST http://localhost:5000/api/meals
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Idli Breakfast",
  "description": "4 Idlis with Chutney",
  "price": 60,
  "category": "Breakfast",
  "provider": "Provider One",
  "image": "https://example.com/idli.jpg"
}



### UPDATE MEAL
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/meals/MEAL_ID
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Updated Veg Lunch",
  "description": "Rice, Curry, Dal, Sweet",
  "price": 150
}



### DELETE MEAL
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/meals/MEAL_ID



